==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~66.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage should be easy provided you have actually reached the point of playing it, but if you do have problems, use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. Bahamut cat is good since he outranges the [[Le'boin]], just meatshield properly and you'll be fine. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] also works for dealing with the peons.

